" Shared by vim and neovim -- ~/.config/nvim/init.vim only sources this file.
" Everything that genuinely differs between the two is guarded with has('nvim').

" Neovim does not look in ~/.vim, so send it there for colors/, syntax/, indent/,
" ftdetect/, after/ and pack/ rather than keeping a second copy of all of it.
